<p>The <strong class="selflink">TOC</strong> template creates a replacement <b>Table of Contents</b> for alphabetical lists:
</p>
<dl><dd><ul><li> The "Contents" or a custom heading can go on top (default) or the side (side=yes).</li>
<li> letters can be omitted and/or merged into ranges: A B C-F G H-K L ...</li>
<li> Other options include: align=center, num=yes, top=yes, seealso=yes, etc.</li></ul></dd></dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h2>
<pre>
{{TOC
|name    =
|side    = yes
|align   = center
|nobreak = yes
|top     = yes
|num     = yes
|sym     = yes
|symnum  =
|seealso = yes
|a       =
:
|z       =
}}
